  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Lives of Teenage Mothers in Medellin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Medellin (Colombia), extreme poverty is the great shadow of some of our teenage mothers who live in vulnerable situations. Their futures and projects are clouded by the lack of opportunities when they become pregnant at an early age.  You can give them back hope and allow them to make their dreams and those of their children come true.</narrative>
  </description>
